silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_03_olog_node_arrow_law_concrete_anchor#tartuclinicintakeform silm:hasLongDescription "The TartuClinicIntakeForm is TartuClinicIntakeForm: the DICOM/HL7 intake form submitted for Mittens's May 2026 annual exam at the Tartu Animal Clinic; the raw source packet before any gate. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'SourcePacket', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
